laicoach.app\",\n    \"gdprCenter.contact.request\": \"Verified privacy request workflow for export or deletion\",\n    \"gdprCenter.contact.title\": \"GDPR questions, objections, or authority escalation\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.lawful.body\": \"Contract, legitimate interest, consent, and legal obligation apply depending on workflow.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.lawful.title\": \"Lawful basis\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.retention.body\": \"Data is retained only as long as necessary for service, safety, or legal duties.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.retention.title\": \"Retention clarity\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.rights.body\": \"Access, correction, deletion, portability, objection, and restriction pathways are available.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.rights.title\": \"Rights available\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.transfer.body\": \"Cross-border processing relies on contractual and technical protection layers.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.fact.transfer.title\": \"Transfer safeguards\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.badge\": \"GDPR TRUST CENTER\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.cta.contact\": \"Contact Privacy Team\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.cta.manage\": \"Manage My Data\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.imageAlt\": \"Abstract cross-border data and compliance background\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.meta.effective\": \"Effective: March 20, 2026\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.meta.sla\": \"Privacy operations target: first response within 72 hours\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.meta.updated\": \"Last updated: March 20, 2026\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.subtitle\": \"This page turns GDPR rights, lawful basis, retention, and transfer language into a real trust and action surface for users and reviewers.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.title\": \"GDPR explained in operational terms, not just legal labels.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.hero.version\": \"Version 2026.2\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.b1\": \"Applies to EEA/UK data rights and related trust obligations\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.b2\": \"Connects legal rights to real product and support workflows\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.b3\": \"Built to help both users and compliance reviewers understand the system quickly\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.p1\": \"RealAICoach acts as a controller for platform account, product, support, and connected-service data to the extent that we decide the purposes and means of processing. Some processors act on our instructions under contractual controls.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.p2\": \"This page summarizes our GDPR-facing commitments for access, correction, deletion, portability, objection, restriction, and privacy contact pathways in a more practical format than a traditional legal memo.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.summary\": \"Explains our role as controller, what data categories fall into scope, and why GDPR applies.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.controller.title\": \"Controller, scope, and lawful framework\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.focus\": \"Pin section\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.lawful.p1\": \"Our primary lawful bases include contract performance, legitimate interest, consent, and legal obligation depending on the data category and workflow involved.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.lawful.p2\": \"Where consent is used, users can withdraw it. Where legitimate interest is used, we aim to keep processing proportionate, explainable, and limited to the stated operational need.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.lawful.summary\": \"Personal data is processed only where a lawful basis supports the purpose.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.lawful.title\": \"Lawful basis for processing\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.b1\": \"Export or delete through the verified privacy request portal\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.b2\": \"Contact the privacy team for rectification, objection, or restriction requests\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.b3\": \"Escalate to a supervisory authority where required by law\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.p1\": \"Users may request access to personal data, correction of inaccurate data, deletion where permitted, portability, restriction, objection, and review of consent-related choices. We also provide a self-service path for export and deletion verification.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.p2\": \"Where a request cannot be completed exactly as submitted, we aim to explain why, what legal or operational limit applies, and what alternative path is available.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.summary\": \"Access, rectification, erasure, portability, objection, restriction, and consent withdrawal are connected to real request flows.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.rights.title\": \"Your GDPR rights\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.transfers.p1\": \"Where personal data is processed outside the EEA or UK, we rely on appropriate safeguards such as contractual protections, provider obligations, and security controls matched to the processing context.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.transfers.p2\": \"Retention depends on product necessity, legal obligation, security needs, and verified deletion requests. Our goal is to keep retention understandable rather than hidden inside vague legal generalities.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.transfers.summary\": \"Cross-border processing and retention are controlled through contractual, technical, and operational safeguards.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.section.transfers.title\": \"International transfers, retention, and safeguards\",\n    \"gdprCenter.sidebar.ctaBody\": \"Use the verified privacy request path for export or deletion, or contact privacy operations for more specific GDPR requests.\",\n    \"gdprCenter.sidebar.ctaButton\": \"Open privacy request flow\",\n    \"gdprCenter.sidebar.ctaTitle\": \"Need to exercise a right?\",\n    \"gdprCenter.sidebar.search\": \"Search GDPR topics\",\n    \"gdprCenter.sidebar.title\": \"Navigate GDPR topics\",\n    \"gdprCenter.summary.title\": \"TL;DR — your GDPR position on this platform\",\n    \"gdprCenter.table.lawful.consen